From: WatchFact <thedataguyshere@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Use the S10 HIDL 2.0 face contract on pinned 4.0.1 firmware

Rebase against S926BXXSHDZI1. Preserve the native Lambda6 enrollment
cancellation runnable; remove only the unused Lambda4 HIDL 3.0 memory-auth
callback. Keep V2.0 transaction numbers, migrate the retained security-level
callback, and align interface and hash chains with HIDL 2.0.
